function nullv($v){$v=trim((string)$v);return($v===''||$v==='-')?null:$v;}function numv($v){$v=trim((string)$v);if($v===''||$v==='-')return null;$v=str_ireplace(['KES','KSH','USD'],'',$v);$v=str_replace([',','$'],'',$v);return is_numeric(trim($v))?(float)trim($v):null;}function locv($v){$v=strtoupper(trim((string)$v));return in_array($v,['KIMATHI','MOI','WAREHOUSE'],true)?$v:null;}
